===Etymology===
From “Ollie”, the nickname of the Florida skateboarder [[w:Alan Gelfand|Alan Gelfand]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|snowboarding|skateboarding|lang=en}} a manoeuvre wherein one [[catch air|catches air]] by lifting the front and tail ends off the ground at the same time; a [[hop]].

===Verb===
{{en-verb|ollies|ollying|pres_ptc2=ollieing|ollied}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To perform an ollie.

